flowchart LR
    APP([宿主应用])
    MEDIA([通信介质对端<br/>TCP/UDP/串口/DDS])
    RT([AsyncTask 运行时<br/>boost.fiber])
    DDS([DDS Provider<br/>可选：Fast DDS])

    TRANSPORT["transport<br/>（通信中间件 CSCI）"]

    APP -->|"装配 codec / 订阅入站业务帧<br/>Send · RequestFor* · Publish / 配置<br/>传输的 Start·Close·WaitClosed 亦由宿主自理"| TRANSPORT
    TRANSPORT -->|"Coro::Result~Message~ / 错误码 / 链路状态<br/>订阅信箱投递 / Trace 事件"| APP

    TRANSPORT -->|字节/样本收发 · connect/close| MEDIA
    MEDIA -->|到达字节/样本 · 断连/错误事件| TRANSPORT

    TRANSPORT -->|makeTask / await / 让出| RT
    RT -->|协程创建/恢复/超时/跨线程唤醒| TRANSPORT

    TRANSPORT -->|Subscribe/Publish topic| DDS
    DDS -->|listener 回调样本| TRANSPORT

    classDef ext fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#93a4b5,color:#233;
    classDef core fill:#eaf3ea,stroke:#4a8c5a,color:#233;
    class APP,MEDIA,RT,DDS ext;
    class TRANSPORT core;
